  "reason": "Follow-ups to the design-system review of 2026-11-20. In onmars v2 the neutral ki-alert icon frame takes the neutral card surface and its glyph text.high-em, kept under reduced transparency by an onmars-only mode layer (spec 011 A2-D4). In Material 3 light the tonal low-em text inks (primary, info, success, warning, danger) take readable inks of their hue, 4.5:1 or more on s0-s2; their descriptions and the tonal med-em descriptions now say so. Value changes of published tokens classify as major. No token, prop, event, part or slot is added, removed or renamed.",
